      "statement": "For EVERY N>=2 and secret s,n=ceil(log2N),the ONE QUDIT-L16-LARGE algorithm exactly specified in proof.md,qudit_decoder.md,robust_decoder.md has unconditional full-secret success>=2/3 under exactly proof0 adaptive error model with epsilon(n)=log2n/(524288n^17),naturalvalue0atn1. Mainn>=2^128 uses capacity-cancelled blocks b<=floor(H/2)-1024u, per-block r=b+ceil(log2(n^5)), explicit O(2^(2b)n^128) vector compilation and ONE wide-top coarse batch(exactSMALLoddgrid or approximateLARGEmesh),low-only prefix verification,explicit finite Clifford+T vector data measurement and guarded verification chains. All parameters,physical instruments and fixed acquisition/iteration caps are reproduced in full. ALLFOUR resource bounds hold JOINTLY on EVERY branch,including wrong prefixes,entangled malformed states,source/LE rejections,failed/capped roots,parameter/circuit synthesis,addresses,actual lookups/tables,wide-grid scores,resets and ALL raw discarded/padding copies. The finite branch has separate all-N correctness and absolute uniform resource constants. Resource envelopes atn1 usepositive n2 values; the fraction naturally vanishes there. F64 is exactly the64-term reciprocal exponent of proof15,with allcoefficientsdeclared. Total charged sequential work is O(n^10 (log2n)^2 2^F64(n)),growthindex1.",
